  "intro": "<p>Gluco Shield Pro diet plan is a structured eating strategy designed to help people manage blood sugar levels through balanced nutrition and mindful food choices. By focusing on low‑glycemic foods, adequate fiber, and moderate protein, the plan supports insulin sensitivity and reduces post‑meal glucose spikes. It is especially useful for those with prediabetes or type 2 diabetes who want a practical, sustainable way to keep blood sugar in check.</p>\n",
